<title>USA: First Financial to buy back 1.5 mln shares.</title>
<headline>First Financial to buy back 1.5 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>STEVENS POINT, Wis. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Financial Corp said Wednesday it intends to repurchase 1.5 million shares or about five percent of its outstanding common stock over the next six months.</p>
<p>The bank holding company now has 29.9 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Under the program, no shares knowingly will be purchased from officers or directors of First Financial or from persons who hold more than five percent of its outstanding common.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
